# 2026-09-12 ("Migration to Valheim 1.0.x"); bumped 1.0.18 -> 1.0.19 on 2026-09-13 (auto-creates
# the ModSentry_Required/ModSentry_Optional folders at startup). Deps: BepInEx only.
